    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Problem\n\nwith `set laststatus=3`, global statusline is shown at bottom of screen, and horizontal splits show WinSeperator instead of statuslines.\n\nbut `laststatus=0` still uses the statusline for horizontal splits.\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nmake `laststatus=0` never show statusline, even for horiz splits.",
